{"repair":{"duration":50.39,"sentences":[{"i":0,"s":0.75,"e":6.07,"text":"What do you do when a strap tears after three years on the trail?","tr":{"fr":"Que faire quand une sangle lâche après trois ans de sentier ?"}},{"i":1,"s":7.23,"e":11.01,"text":"Um, most brands would just sell you a new bag.","tr":{"fr":"La plupart des marques vous vendraient un sac neuf."}},{"i":2,"s":11.42,"e":15.98,"text":"This Ridge 28L came back to our Annecy workshop last week.","tr":{"fr":"Ce Ridge 28L est revenu à notre atelier d’Annecy la semaine dernière."}},{"i":3,"s":16.39,"e":21.07,"text":"So first, we unpick the old webbing, one stitch at a time.","tr":{"fr":"D’abord, on découd l’ancienne sangle, point par point."}},{"i":4,"s":22.03,"e":27.57,"text":"Then we cut new webbing, uh, from the same roll we use in production.","tr":{"fr":"Puis on coupe une sangle neuve, du même rouleau qu’en production."}},{"i":5,"s":27.98,"e":31.32,"text":"Forty-two bar-tack stitches hold it in place.","tr":{"fr":"Quarante-deux points d’arrêt la tiennent en place."}},{"i":6,"s":32.58,"e":36.8,"text":"It took twenty minutes, and it cost the owner nothing.","tr":{"fr":"Ça a pris vingt minutes, et ça n’a rien coûté à son propriétaire."}},{"i":7,"s":37.21,"e":40.68,"text":"Every Ridge comes with free repairs for life.","tr":{"fr":"Chaque Ridge est réparé gratuitement, à vie."}},{"i":8,"s":41.54,"e":45.88,"text":"You know, the greenest bag is the one you already own.","tr":{"fr":"Le sac le plus écologique, c’est celui que vous avez déjà."}},{"i":9,"s":46.29,"e":49.83,"text":"Send it to Annecy, and we’ll stitch it back.","tr":{"fr":"Envoyez-le à Annecy, on le recoud."}}],"words":[{"i":0,"w":"What","s":0.75,"e":1.09,"sent":0},{"i":1,"w":"do","s":1.15,"e":1.38,"sent":0},{"i":2,"w":"you","s":1.44,"e":1.73,"sent":0},{"i":3,"w":"do","s":1.78,"e":2.01,"sent":0},{"i":4,"w":"when","s":2.07,"e":2.41,"sent":0},{"i":5,"w":"a","s":2.47,"e":2.65,"sent":0},{"i":6,"w":"strap","s":2.71,"e":3.1,"sent":0},{"i":7,"w":"tears","